# Rules for this repository (owner's standing instructions)

- Work only on branch `fix/phase1-safety`. Never switch to, merge into, or push any branch.
- NEVER run `pnpm cf:deploy`, `wrangler deploy`, `cap sync`, `railway`, or anything that publishes or deploys. Deploying needs the owner's explicit approval, given in chat, every time.
- Never `git push`. Commit locally, one commit per card.
- Never print, read out or commit secrets (.env, .dev.vars, tokens, keys).
- Run `pnpm check` and `pnpm test` after every card. If tests fail, fix them or stop and report. Never weaken or delete an existing test to make it pass.
- Do not touch the limits that card 07 will change. Cards 01–06 only.
- When a card is ambiguous, stop and ask. Don't guess.

## Known failure that predates this work (checked 14 Nov 2026)
- `suite-nav.test.mjs` line 69 expects `label="Coastal air forecast"` in DecisionView.tsx. It already fails on the untouched base commit 93078fc: commit 0195af3 (15 Oct) renamed the labels and the test was not updated. Do NOT fix or change that test. The bar is: `pnpm check` passes, all Vitest tests pass, and `node --test suite-nav.test.mjs` shows no failure other than this one.
- pnpm is not on PATH. Use `./node_modules/.bin/pnpm` or `npx pnpm@10.4.1`.
